<title>USA: Marsh Supermarkets Inc Q2 net increases.</title>
<headline>Marsh Supermarkets Inc Q2 net increases.</headline>
<dateline>INDIANAPOLIS 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr primary prof	 $0.33   profit	 $0.26</p>
<p> Shr diluted prof	  0.31   profit	  0.26</p>
<p> Net profit		 2,739   profit	 2,231</p>
<p> Revs		     449,099		  425,811</p>
<p> Avg shrs primary	 8,411		    8,445</p>
<p> Avg shrs diluted	 9,702		    9,741</p>
<p>	  6  MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr primary loss	 $0.52   profit	 $0.64</p>
<p> Shr diluted loss	  0.40   profit	  0.60</p>
<p> Net loss		   4,373   profit	 5,366</p>
<p> Revs		     784,943		  745,346</p>
<p> Avg shrs primary	 8,424		    8,435</p>
<p> Avg shrs diluted	 9,714		    9,748</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE - Q2 1996 ended October 12, 1996; Q2 1995 ended October 14, 1995.</p>
<p>-- New York newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
